{
  "work_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii",
  "source_path": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii.json",
  "source_language": "chu",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107r",
      "source_sha256": "fda34d94e2d66f7d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "March 23. The martyrdom of Saint Dometius and his disciples."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "7935c95d80460e1d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Julian then arrived in the city of Antioch—for he should not be called emperor."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "e8369d150f1e3831",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It is enough to call him a lawless man and a transgressor, since he transgressed God's commandments and sacrificed to idols."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "e3bd7e9b0201bb71",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For he had been instructed in the words of God and had been appointed a deacon among the clergy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "c28fdf33ba4011d0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He had carried the most pure Mysteries and stood ministering in the sanctuary."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "b15dac4f10157756",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He abandoned his rank—or rather, he did not abandon it, but God brought him to disgrace as unworthy,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "bc05048cca62cbcf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because he had imitated Judas's deceit [?]. So, upon entering the city of Antioch,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "16b3d689da0fad91",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he persecuted the devout, while he cherished and supported those who persecuted them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "5a6c19bfc44ca950",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Others he compelled to deny God, thus fulfilling what the apostle said:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "1a9264cfb84ea8d1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Wicked people and sorcerers will go from bad to worse, deceiving through their deceptions.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "e9ccf34d887c7a50",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But those who stood upon the firm rock mocked him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "55ef1557c9383a6c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this man was not simple and ignorant, but cunning, using glory and wealth"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "0fcc8d418b586e5e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to deceive the souls of those built upon sand. So he entered the city,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.107v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "6643647b6623c56e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and the great church that Emperor Constantine had built he reviled and dishonored,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "9adf7bc52412370f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "making it a stable for horses and setting the sanctuary apart as a place for his own horse to stand."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "730b9b1eee132975",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Such were the many evils he inflicted upon God's honored church. Then war arose against that impious man from Assyria,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "39384cbfcaa25e0c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and he had to go and fight. He set out for war, and as he was traveling along the road,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "f26889ea01b5f631",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "some people approached him and brought accusations against the righteous Dometius. The tyrant gladly received these accusers"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "3c4c72a13080f612",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and answered, saying, “Go and bring him to me.” Hearing this, those wretched men rejoiced and praised the tyrant,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "a09f863504eb50de",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that his rage against the Christians would remain firm and unrelenting."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "fb734b51dce1a961",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They ran to the cave of Saint Domitian and saw him looking like an angel,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "ec718fcab0ba9fe3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "standing with his hands stretched out toward heaven and offering a song of thanksgiving to God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "96a7f3412ac07a42",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "together with his two disciples. At first they were struck with awe"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "5fbc21aa100ef93c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and said to one another, “How can we approach such a martyr [?]?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "bdc4a0b8575c4c7c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or what charge can we find to bring about his destruction? Will we not bring sin upon ourselves?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "e9f80388f9706e00",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But others said, “Let us drive him out of these lands.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "9917f4943bc2abcf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“What if he draws all the people to himself, and they believe in the one born of Mary,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "274a06710384d26f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "whom the Jews once crucified with two robbers, as someone deserving death?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "020cd5c349326eb7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The emperor, the nobles, and the princes were angry with the Christians."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "652357f351c68037",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Who [?] to kill this man? Come, then, let us see what they are.” And when they went up to that holy man,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "0fe21cb09f222234",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they saw him standing with his two disciples, saying the prayer of the sixth hour. And they said to him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "9f8d944cb0ce6ad8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Come out; prepare to travel to the emperor.” But he did not answer them and continued in his prayer."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "c88eb32f216ac7b9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again they said to him, “Come out; prepare to travel [?] to the emperor, for he is coming here.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "0fd090263d9b30de",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But he, unwilling to leave his prayer, did not answer them a word. Immediately, like bloodthirsty lions,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "c4897a591cd683fa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they rushed at him, gnashing their teeth, and picked up stones and threw them at him"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "654478155dbd317c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and at both his disciples. Those godless men threw so many stones at the righteous man"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.108v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "db7aa562e3d163c3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that they filled the cave with stones, so that the cave could no longer be recognized. And thus the holy man surrendered his soul"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "fffe5275dbf68bd1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to the Lord, together with his two disciples. And that cave became the tomb of the righteous man and his disciples. Those who had killed the righteous man ran"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "8361dc8d59843799",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and reported everything that had happened to Emperor Julian, saying, “We have killed the righteous man.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "d0aec66ae277097c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Oh, that lawless fury! Oh, the blindness at that time of the unbelieving people"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "5efd1210039744f4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who killed the faithful and sought to defile righteousness with blood,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "4b40d11666bdd2d0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "striving and searching everywhere to kill the worker of godliness!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "5cf43817c0622ed4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But leaving aside this fury of those godless men against the godly,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "fb96b1951e9fd004",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I will return to the account of Saint Domitian. The site of the holy man’s cave"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "ebd492062402d011",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "was obliterated and became unknown, covered with the stones they had thrown at the righteous man."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "62dc49723eb156b0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It became overgrown with thick vegetation and thorns. For to this very day, that mountainside remains overgrown."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "bbe1fffc553fd52e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When two years had passed after the holy man’s death, a certain merchant happened"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "555a9a2e59e0217c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to drive his camels there and pasture them in that place. While the camels were grazing there,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "9aa1b504c02e95f2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "one of them happened to go down near the village and enter a field,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "118bc473599444fc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "wanting to eat. When the owner of that field saw it, he ran to drive it out. As it was being driven out, it fell into a [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "8ac172632f68f528",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and broke its front leg. And a dispute arose between the owner of the camel"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "2f0f28551efcd607",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and the owner of the field. He abandoned it in the hills, at the place where the holy man lay,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "6b935c2393ae5390",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "unseen by anyone. Its owner then went to the city of Cyrrhus and told the governor about the field"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "c2eced1bea8be567",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and how they had crippled his camel. The camel was left there for four days,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "ec6bc34f65699ff5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "lying in that place and trying to get up, but unable to steady its broken leg."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "ab94c3553dbe4e21",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It took a step, and its leg went into an opening in the cave where the relics of the saints were."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "644517d87744cb67",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Immediately the camel’s leg became firm and sound. When its owner arrived, he hurried toward it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "3514c22590ae88ec",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the camel saw him, it pulled its leg free and ran to meet him. When he saw it, he was astonished"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "c0917921b10bfa2d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and praised and glorified the Lord. His companions asked him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "8e89f29e8e5c96de",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“What is this marvelous thing?” He told them, “I left it lame in that place.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.109v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "8d1d0157af9a9cdb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They said to him, “Come and show us, so that we may see the place more clearly.” And they went to the place"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "3d417ae229a9be60",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and found a large opening. Immediately some of them said to him, “Truly, this is the place of Saint Dometius."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "f27a324012657dbe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Here, then, we shall also find his holy relics.” They went and brought priests to offer prayers at the place."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "679053631175d6a6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They took hoes and spades and dug. When they found the relics, they brought them out with songs and praises"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "47d0aa24791abc45",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and with fitting honor, and carried them into the church of the village there."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "7a07001e822a333b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A large crowd gathered, intending to seize the relics of the righteous man"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "e72a1460ef93c14e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and of his disciple. They rebuked them as troublemakers. But those who loved the saints"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "b9e28a6399eec602",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "took their relics and laid them in a holy place. There was a great celebration in those regions."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "a8614159c619d1a4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For everyone gathered together—priests and clerics, laypeople and monks,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "bcb703a7ca295329",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and abbots—and held a great celebration. They observe the commemoration of the holy relics"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "239ac3977c9d985d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "even to this day. This is the life of Saint Dometius. This is the martyrdom of the righteous man."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "8f51b16390ff2210",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "These are the labors of the venerable man, pleasing to God and to the fathers and angels"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "7793f27791ed5861",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and people. Because of these things he is especially beloved by God, honored by princes, and venerated by priests"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "212bc35967c722bf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and devout people. He also has the boldness to pray to God for us. To him be glory and dominion,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-dometii#Supr.110v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "2a69f56a47972b57",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "together with the Father and the Holy Spirit, now and always and forever and ever. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
